{
  // Banks a flow's bank step can use: `bank @<id>`, or `bank nearest`, which takes the one on the player's floor that
  // a walk from the player reaches first when the step starts (the closest in a straight line when none is within
  // 200 steps).
  //
  //   id     unique, what flows refer to
  //   name   shown to the player
  //   booth  tile of a bank booth (z = floor, 0 by default); the step walks to a tile it can be used from
  //
  // Booths come from the cache (2026-10-03 survey of booth clusters, .memory/artifacts/2026-10-03-booth-clusters.txt);
  // BanksDataTest checks that every tile holds one. Listed: the ground-floor banks a character can walk to from
  // Lumbridge without a requirement. Left out: Tutorial Island, the Fishing Guild, Castle Wars, Nardah (Shantay
  // pass), Port Phasmatys and Mos Le'Harmless, the Void Knights' outpost, banks upstairs (Gnome Stronghold, Canifis)
  // and underground. There is no bank in Lumbridge in this revision. Walked to and used live: varrock_west and
  // draynor (2026-09-30); the others are checked against the cache only.
  "banks": [
    { "id": "varrock_west", "name": "Varrock west bank", "booth": { "x": 3186, "y": 3440 } },
